 you can show surprise. <br>You use these phrases to show surprise:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter! I won the lottery!<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? Crazy!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Polite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Casual\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"My goodness!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Oh my gosh!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Wow!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Really?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's surprising!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Who knew?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Really?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Crazy!\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"No way!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Oh my God!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to express surprise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I won the lottery! <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh my God!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in conversations about surprising news."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shocked"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very surprised "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was so shocked I won!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "